# 🌐 HTML Learning Roadmap

A beginner-friendly HTML learning roadmap designed for an **8th-class student** who is starting web development from scratch.

The goal of this repository is not just to memorize HTML tags, but to **understand how webpages work and build real projects step by step**.

---

## 🎯 Learning Goal

By the end of this course, the student should be able to:

* Understand how websites and webpages work
* Write HTML from scratch
* Understand HTML tags and attributes
* Create structured webpages
* Add images, links, audio, and video
* Create tables and forms
* Understand semantic HTML
* Use proper file and folder structures
* Build multiple webpages
* Create a complete personal website

---

## 🗺️ Roadmap

### 🟢 Level 1 — HTML Basics

* [ ] What is HTML?
* [ ] What is a webpage?
* [ ] What is a browser?
* [ ] HTML tags
* [ ] Opening and closing tags
* [ ] HTML document structure
* [ ] `<!DOCTYPE html>`
* [ ] `<html>`
* [ ] `<head>`
* [ ] `<title>`
* [ ] `<body>`

### 🟢 Level 2 — Text & Content

* [ ] Headings `<h1>` – `<h6>`
* [ ] Paragraphs `<p>`
* [ ] Line breaks `<br>`
* [ ] Horizontal lines `<hr>`
* [ ] Bold `<b>`
* [ ] Strong `<strong>`
* [ ] Italic `<i>`
* [ ] Emphasis `<em>`
* [ ] Highlight `<mark>`
* [ ] Small text `<small>`
* [ ] Deleted text `<del>`
* [ ] Inserted text `<ins>`
* [ ] Subscript `<sub>`
* [ ] Superscript `<sup>`

### 🟡 Level 3 — Links, Images & Lists

* [ ] Links `<a>`
* [ ] `href`
* [ ] `target`
* [ ] Images `<img>`
* [ ] `src`
* [ ] `alt`
* [ ] Unordered lists `<ul>`
* [ ] Ordered lists `<ol>`
* [ ] List items `<li>`
* [ ] Nested lists

### 🟡 Level 4 — Tables

* [ ] `<table>`
* [ ] `<tr>`
* [ ] `<th>`
* [ ] `<td>`
* [ ] `colspan`
* [ ] `rowspan`

### 🟡 Level 5 — Forms

* [ ] `<form>`
* [ ] `<label>`
* [ ] Text input
* [ ] Password input
* [ ] Email input
* [ ] Number input
* [ ] Date input
* [ ] File input
* [ ] Radio buttons
* [ ] Checkboxes
* [ ] Submit button
* [ ] Reset button
* [ ] `<select>`
* [ ] `<option>`
* [ ] `<textarea>`

### 🔵 Level 6 — HTML5 Media

* [ ] `<audio>`
* [ ] `<video>`
* [ ] `<source>`
* [ ] `<iframe>`

### 🔵 Level 7 — Page Structure

* [ ] `<div>`
* [ ] `<span>`
* [ ] `<header>`
* [ ] `<nav>`
* [ ] `<main>`
* [ ] `<section>`
* [ ] `<article>`
* [ ] `<aside>`
* [ ] `<footer>`

### 🔵 Level 8 — Important Concepts

* [ ] HTML attributes
* [ ] `id`
* [ ] `class`
* [ ] `title`
* [ ] `name`
* [ ] `value`
* [ ] `placeholder`
* [ ] `required`
* [ ] `disabled`
* [ ] HTML comments
* [ ] Relative paths
* [ ] File and folder structure
* [ ] Multiple HTML pages

### 🟣 Level 9 — Forms & Accessibility

* [ ] HTML5 form validation
* [ ] `required`
* [ ] `min`
* [ ] `max`
* [ ] `minlength`
* [ ] `maxlength`
* [ ] `placeholder`
* [ ] Meaningful `alt` text
* [ ] Proper form labels
* [ ] Semantic HTML
* [ ] Basic accessibility

### 🟣 Level 10 — HTML Entities

Learn commonly used entities:

```text
&lt;    <
&gt;    >
&amp;   &
&nbsp;  space
&copy; ©
```

---

# 📚 Lesson Structure

Each lesson follows the same process:

### 1. Learn

Understand the concept.

### 2. See

Look at a simple example.

### 3. Type

Write the code manually.

### 4. Break

Change or remove something and observe what happens.

### 5. Build

Create something using the concept.

### 6. Challenge

Build something without copying the example.

---

# 🧪 Practice Projects

## Project 1 — My First Webpage

Learn:

* HTML structure
* Headings
* Paragraphs

---

## Project 2 — About Me

Include:

* Name
* Photo
* Introduction
* Hobbies
* Favourite subjects

---

## Project 3 — My Favourite Things

Include:

* Lists
* Images
* Links
* Text formatting

---

## Project 4 — Student Marks Table

Create a table containing:

* Student name
* Subject
* Marks
* Total
* Result

---

## Project 5 — Student Registration Form

Include:

* Name
* Email
* Password
* Date of birth
* Gender
* Hobbies
* Class
* City
* Address
* Submit button
* Reset button

---

## Project 6 — School Website

Create multiple pages:

```text
Home
About
Teachers
Students
Contact
```

Use:

* Navigation
* Images
* Tables
* Lists
* Forms
* Semantic HTML

---

# 🏆 Final Project — Personal Website

Build a complete personal website from scratch.

### Required pages

```text
my-website/
│
├── index.html
├── about.html
├── hobbies.html
├── contact.html
│
├── images/
│   ├── profile.jpg
│   └── gallery.jpg
│
└── pages/
```

### Website requirements

* [ ] Header
* [ ] Navigation bar
* [ ] Introduction
* [ ] Profile image
* [ ] About section
* [ ] Hobbies
* [ ] Favourite subjects
* [ ] Skills
* [ ] Links
* [ ] Contact form
* [ ] Footer
* [ ] Multiple webpages
* [ ] Images
* [ ] Lists
* [ ] At least one table
* [ ] Semantic HTML

